  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto and National Police Chief Suyudi Ario Seto oversaw the destruction of 601.7 tons of narcotics seized in recent operations.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto and Police Chief General Suyudi Ario Seto destroyed over 601 tons of seized narcotics in Jakarta.",
    "The National Police reported uncovering 56,203 drug-related cases over the past year, resulting in the arrest of 812 drug kingpins.",
    "President Prabowo assigned the police to prioritize the eradication of illegal drugs, smuggling, and online gambling across the nation."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "On November 26, 2026, President Prabowo Subianto and National Police Chief General Suyudi Ario Seto led a ceremony at the Bhayangkara Field in Jakarta to destroy 601.74 tons of confiscated narcotics. This evidence, valued at approximately 61.69 trillion rupiah, was accumulated through 56,203 investigations conducted by the Bareskrim Polri and regional police units over the preceding year. During the event, the National Police highlighted the arrest of 812 drug ringleaders as part of a wider crackdown on 11,623 locations identified as drug hubs. General Suyudi Ario Seto reiterated his commitment to internal accountability, pledging to dismiss any police personnel found facilitating drug trafficking networks. President Prabowo issued a direct mandate to the National Police to intensify efforts against narcotics, smuggling, and online gambling, describing these activities as critical threats to national security and the well-being of the younger generation.",
